Installation
Icons are published as a separate package from the main UI kit. Install with your preferred package manager:

npm install @telekom-ods/react-icons · yarn add @telekom-ods/react-icons · pnpm add @telekom-ods/react-icons

Usage
Each icon is a React component exported by name from @telekom-ods/react-icons. Import only the icons you need; unused icons are tree-shaken at build time.

import { ODSSearch } from "@telekom-ods/react-icons";

export function MyComponent() {
  return <ODSSearch decorative />;
}
Copy
Multiple icons in one component:

import { ODSAdd, ODSClose } from "@telekom-ods/react-icons";

export function MyComponent() {
  return (
    <>
      <ODSAdd aria-hidden="true" />
      <ODSClose title="Close dialog" />
    </>
  );
}
